     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Could someone advise how to do a regression line for the following data and code?  I used the <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">stat_smooth(method=&quot;lm&quot;)</font>code but would like to see the equation r2 etc with don&#39;t really need the 5&amp;95th percentiles.  Data and code included.<div>\r\n<br></div><div>Thank you,</div><div>JOH</div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">ggplot(dt, aes(Sales1, Sales2))+geom_point(aes(colour = factor(Store)),size=3, alpha=1)+ stat_smooth(method = &quot;lm&quot;)</font><br>\r\n</div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"195\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:195pt\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"3\" style=\"width:65pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" width=\"65\" style=\"height:15pt;width:65pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Store</font></td>\r\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Sales1</font></td>\r\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Sales2</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">1</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">513</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">1077.3</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">2</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">515</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">1081.5</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" alig